{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國監管機構正計劃為自動駕駛汽車制定全新的視覺識別標準。根據美國國家公路交通安全管理局（NHTSA）最新提出的監管改革方案，未來無人駕駛汽車或可使用獨特的青綠色（Cyan）外部標識燈，以明確告知執法人員和其他道路使用者車輛當前正由自動駕駛系統控制，而非人類駕駛員操作。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583612.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:44:06.031042+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:19:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:38:13.293149+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:38:13.293149+00:00","content_hash":"03bd0f8c3167300fd3319778cc65cd98ff400c6589e275f6d5cf0a7c5b80a702","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}